# DESK01 -- Desk -> Desktop info... on the base image.
# Menu titles (kernel/src/desk/menu.rs adjust_menu, active_x = 2*8 = 16):
#   Desk 16..64, File 64..112, View 112..160, Options 160..232.
# Desk drop-down entry 0 ("  Desktop info... ") at y = 19 + 0*16 = 19..35.
# The About box is 384x276 and form_center puts it at (128, 111); its OK
# button is (dw-90)/2 = 147 in, 224 down, 90x28 -> centre (320, 349).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 40 8
1800 mark B_DESK_OPEN
2100 move 60 27
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr
3000 mark C_ABOUT
3300 move 320 349
3500 down
3503 up
3800 parkbr
4200 mark D_CLOSED
